 "category_zh": "历史遗址",
 "category_en": "Historic site",
 "intro_zh": "清西陵是清朝最后一处帝王陵墓群。清西陵以14座陵寝为主，行宫、永福寺、营房、衙署为辅的83平方公里的广袤陵区，是现存规模宏大、保存最完整、陵寝建筑类型最齐全的古代皇家陵墓群。景点主要有泰陵、昌西陵、慕陵、崇陵、永福寺。2000年被列入《世界文化遗产名录》。",
 "intro_en": "The Qingxi Mausoleum is the last imperial tomb complex in the Qing Dynasty. The Western Mausoleum of the Qing Dynasty consists of 14 mausoleums, supplemented by palaces, Yongfu Temple, barracks, and government offices, covering a vast mausoleum area of ​​83 square kilometers. It is an ancient royal mausoleum group with the largest scale, the most complete preservation, and the most complete types of mausoleum buildings. The main attractions include Tailing Tomb, Changxi Tomb, Muling Tomb, Chongling Tomb and Yongfu Temple. It was included in the \"World Cultural Heritage List\" in 2000.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
